   sense according to the settings in that game"): each game asks for ITS
   OWN settings, by the game's own names, ranges, defaults and steps
   (game-settings-games.js, window.ZSGAMESCHEMA), on two tabs: Controller and
   Keyboard & Mouse (Native Mouse & Keyboard: the keyboard and mouse reach
   the game as themselves, and the scripts and AI still run on top).

